###
### FOLLOW/UNFOLLOW OPERATIONS
###

### Toggle follow - Profile1 follows Profile4 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile4}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile1}}

### Toggle follow - Profile1 unfollows Profile4 (existing follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile4}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile1}}

### Toggle follow - Profile1 tries to follow Profile2 (already following)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile2}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile1}}

### Toggle follow - Profile3 follows Profile5 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile5}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile3}}

### Toggle follow - Profile6 tries to follow Profile3 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile3}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile6}}

### Toggle follow - Profile5 unfollows Profile2 (existing follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile2}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile5}}

### Toggle follow - Profile7 follows Profile8 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile8}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile7}}

### Toggle follow - Profile9 follows Profile10 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile10}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile9}}

### Toggle follow - Profile10 follows Profile7 (new follow)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/follows/{{profile7}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile10}}

