PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile2}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile1}}

### Toggle block - Profile2 blocks Profile4 (already blocked)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile4}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile2}}

### Toggle block - Profile4 blocks Profile6 (new block)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile6}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile4}}

### Toggle block - Profile6 blocks Profile2 (new block)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile2}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile6}}

### Toggle block - Profile1 blocks Profile5 (new block)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile5}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile1}}

### Toggle block - Profile7 blocks Profile3 (already blocked in seeder)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile3}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile7}}

### Toggle block - Profile8 blocks Profile9 (new block)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile9}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile8}}

### Toggle block - Profile10 blocks Profile2 (already blocked in seeder)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/blocks/{{profile2}}
X-Profile-Id: {{profile10}}

